# I'm afraid I'll forget in Russian: боюсь, что; сомневаюсь
subtitle: "Боюсь, что не сдам; боюсь забыть; сомневаюсь, что ты забудешь: fear, doubt and being sure in Russian."
tags: ["russian","боюсь что","сомневаюсь","fear and doubt","russian grammar"]
teaches: ["grammar/linking-words","vocabulary/feelings"]
thumb: "band \"I'm afraid I'll forget, in Russian\" stamp \"ЧТО?\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Russian intonation: statement, question, А ты?","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/169-russian-intonation.cast"}

